{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/1b941c516955c80309f8fb1ba46bc63b.poster.avif?t=1773075058\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/1b941c516955c80309f8fb1ba46bc63b.webm?t=1773075058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/1b941c516955c80309f8fb1ba46bc63b.mp4?t=1773075058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gumblaster Mayhem</strong> is a <strong>3D retro-style first-person shooter game</strong> where you, as a player, acquire three different types of guns. They can all shoot gumballs, but each gumball has various colours and behaviours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sour mutants are trying to take over the world of Gumblaster Mayhem, known as Sweetopia. The player needs to take down these creatures before it's too late, corrupting different areas with their sourness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/17f8d6fa3071597c10bec573233d753c.poster.avif?t=1773075058\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/17f8d6fa3071597c10bec573233d753c.webm?t=1773075058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/17f8d6fa3071597c10bec573233d753c.mp4?t=1773075058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Multiple Arena-Like Levels</strong></u> <strong>-\u00a0</strong>Fight the sour mutants in different colourful and sweet arena-like levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Timed Survival</strong></u>\u00a0- Survive each level for 5 minutes, as well as defeating the boss, which is the main sourness pollution for that level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>3 Weapons System</strong></u> <strong>-\u00a0</strong>The player carries 3 weapons that are used to take down the sour mutants, and they can be swapped between each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Spawning Presents</u></strong> - A present will spawn between 10 and 15 seconds, and if the player gets the present, they will be able to temporarily hold another weapon at the same time as carrying one of the 3 weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Pixelated Render Texture</strong></u>\u00a0- The players can play the game with pixelated visuals, giving the game a retro feeling. However, the player can turn it off through the settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>CRT Filter</strong></u> -\u00a0The players have the option to turn on the CRT filter through the settings, which gives the screen the feeling of playing on an old CRT display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u><strong>Gumballs Bouncing Physics</strong></u> -\u00a0When gumballs are coming out from one of the 3 weapons, the gumballs can bounce around on any environmental objects... basically everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mouse &amp; Keyboard and Gamepad Support</strong></u>\u00a0-\u00a0The game can be played either with a mouse &amp; keyboard or with a gamepad. This is entirely up to the players.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015840?t=1773075058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015840?t=1773075058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/8ba97bd7de10ce05df7b4378ebd031db1dcefb63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773075058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/8ba97bd7de10ce05df7b4378ebd031db1dcefb63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773075058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/1b941c516955c80309f8fb1ba46bc63b.poster.avif?t=1773075058\" width=720 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/1b941c516955c80309f8fb1ba46bc63b.webm?t=1773075058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/extras/1b941c516955c80309f8fb1ba46bc63b.mp4?t=1773075058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gumblaster Mayhem</strong> is a <strong>3D retro-style first-person shooter game</strong> where you, as a player, acquire three different types of guns. They can all shoot gumballs, but each gumball has various colours and behaviours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sour mutants are trying to take over the world of Gumblaster Mayhem, known as Sweetopia. The player needs to take down these creatures before it's too late, corrupting different areas with their sourness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/