g of playing on an old CRT display.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <u><strong>Gumballs Bouncing Physics</strong></u> -\u00a0When gumballs are coming out from one of the 3 weapons, the gumballs can bounce around on any environmental objects... basically everywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Mouse &amp; Keyboard and Gamepad Support</strong></u>\u00a0-\u00a0The game can be played either with a mouse &amp; keyboard or with a gamepad. This is entirely up to the players.</p>","developers":["Summoning Kristian"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/1b39411909b9b4228f597727e5cf1dabdaff57de/header.jpg?t=1773075058","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015840/1481304868/993144f0bb07b94f8c999274ffeea771a10b12fe/1767644307/dash_av1.mpd?t=1767645447","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015840/1481304868/993144f0bb07b94f8c999274ffeea771a10b12fe/1767644307/dash_h264.mpd?t=1767645447","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4015840/1481304868/993144f0bb07b94f8c999274ffeea771a10b12fe/1767644307/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1767645447","id":257260051,"name":"Gumblaster Mayhem Gameplay Trailer!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257260051/1a9bcbf69753eead5815153ef2ea17bdec6b6780/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1767645447"}],"name":"Gumblaster Mayhem","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 / AMD Ra