64ac4ddcfc9284e52dc285b4c4af520e0a1/ss_333da64ac4ddcfc9284e52dc285b4c4af520e0a1.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773075058","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/333da64ac4ddcfc9284e52dc285b4c4af520e0a1/ss_333da64ac4ddcfc9284e52dc285b4c4af520e0a1.600x338.jpg?t=1773075058"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/d6c64f049ad33597a0e8a7cb5acd4776ee9b36f5/ss_d6c64f049ad33597a0e8a7cb5acd4776ee9b36f5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773075058","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/d6c64f049ad33597a0e8a7cb5acd4776ee9b36f5/ss_d6c64f049ad33597a0e8a7cb5acd4776ee9b36f5.600x338.jpg?t=1773075058"},{"id":10,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/b763350c69a451af4aedecfb4eb7f61f60f2733b/ss_b763350c69a451af4aedecfb4eb7f61f60f2733b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1773075058","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015840/b763350c69a451af4aedecfb4eb7f61f60f2733b/ss_b763350c69a451af4aedecfb4eb7f61f60f2733b.600x338.jpg?t=1773075058"}],"short_description":"Gumblaster Mayhem is a 3D retro-style first-person shooter game where you, as a player, shoot out some gumballs using the three weapons that you must use to take down the sour mutants to survive.","steam_appid":4015840,"support_info":{"email":"summoningkristian@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}